// occams-machete: a review "lens" bundle for Amplifier. It adds three
// advisory reviewers — a blunt reliability engineer, an architectural
// judgment lens (MJ), and a decisive code/prose reducer that actually
// trims bloat — plus the context and inline-callout wiring they need.
digraph occams_machete {
    rankdir=LR
    fontname="Helvetica"
    fontsize=12
    label="occams-machete v0.1.0 — Code & Prose Reduction Review Lenses\nThree advisory reviewers that trim bloat and pressure-test decisions"
